OL,3,AUS 'watching closely' after plague
OL,4,Aresearcher dies in Russia, Rubio says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US says it is closely monitoring
OL,7,Fthe case of a Russian lab technician
OL,8,Fwho died at a plague research centre in
OL,9,FSiberia.
OL,11,FSecretary of State Marco Rubio said
OL,12,Fthere was concern the incident could
OL,13,Fhave led to the spread of pneumonic
OL,14,Fplague, but that there was no cause for
OL,15,Falarm.
OL,17,FAnnouncing the cause of death as
OL,18,F"pneumonia of undetermined etiology",
OL,19,FIrkutsk's governor said that "no
OL,20,Fmicro-organisms" linked to the woman's
OL,21,Fwork had been found "in her biological
OL,22,Fsamples".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
