OL,3,AUS 'watching closely' after plague
OL,4,Aresearcher dies in Russia, Rubio says
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnconfirmed reports had suggested the
OL,7,Fwoman fell ill either after breaking a
OL,8,Ftest tube containing the pathogen or
OL,9,Ffollowing a field trip to a region
OL,10,Fwhere plague is found naturally among
OL,11,Fwild rodents.
